<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('../partials/head-links', { pageTitle: 'Community Service', pageCss: 'community-service.css' }) %>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app">
<%- include('../partials/sidebar', { activePage: 'community-service' }) %>
    <main class="main">
<%- include('../partials/topbar', { student }) %>


      <section class="page-header">
        <h1>Community Service</h1>
        <p>What is the need in our community, and how can we help? <span class="cs-grades">Grades 9&ndash;12</span></p>
      </section>

      <section class="cs-what">
        <h2 class="cs-label">What is community service?</h2>
        <p>Giving your time to help a community in a way that matters, through a cause you care about.</p>
        <div class="cs-ways">
          <div class="cs-way">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M3.5 19C3.5 15.9 6 14 9 14C12 14 14.5 15.9 14.5 19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M16 5.5C17.7 5.8 19 7.2 19 9C19 10.5 18.2 11.7 17 12.3M17.5 14.3C19.6 14.9 21 16.5 21 19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
            <strong>With</strong><small>Work alongside people</small>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-way">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="9" width="16" height="11" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M12 9V20M3 9H21V6.5C21 6.2 20.8 6 20.5 6H3.5C3.2 6 3 6.2 3 6.5V9Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M12 6C12 6 10.5 3 8.5 3.5C7 4 7.5 6 9 6H12ZM12 6C12 6 13.5 3 15.5 3.5C17 4 16.5 6 15 6H12Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            <strong>For</strong><small>Do something for them</small>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-way">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 10V14C3 14.6 3.4 15 4 15H6.5L13 19V5L6.5 9H4C3.4 9 3 9.4 3 10Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M17.5 9.5C18.5 10.6 18.5 13.4 17.5 14.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M20 7C22 9.5 22 14.5 20 17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
            <strong>About</strong><small>Speak up on an issue</small>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <div class="cs-layout">
        <div class="cs-main">
          <section class="cs-path-card">
            <h2 class="cs-label">Your path</h2>
            <ol class="cs-path">
              <li><span class="cs-icon cs-icon-solid"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="6.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M16 16L20.5 20.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><strong>Investigate</strong><small>Find a need and research it</small></li>
              <li><span class="cs-icon cs-icon-solid"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="4" width="14" height="17" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M9 4V3H15V4M9 10H15M9 14H13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><strong>Plan</strong><small>Design a project or pick an organization</small></li>
              <li><span class="cs-icon cs-icon-solid"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 21V4M5 4H17L14.5 8L17 12H5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><strong>Act</strong><small>Carry out your service</small></li>
              <li><span class="cs-icon cs-icon-solid"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3L14.5 8.5L20.5 9.2L16 13.2L17.3 19.2L12 16L6.7 19.2L8 13.2L3.5 9.2L9.5 8.5L12 3Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><strong>Reflect</strong><small>Think about your impact</small></li>
            </ol>
          </section>

          <section class="cs-events-section" id="cs-events-section">
            <h2 class="cs-heading">Open opportunities</h2>
            <div class="cs-events-list" id="cs-events-list"></div>
            <div class="cs-events-empty" id="cs-events-empty">
              <span class="cs-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="17" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M3 9H21M8 2V5M16 2V5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span>
              <span>Nothing posted right now. Clubs add volunteer opportunities here, so check back soon.</span>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>

        <aside class="cs-rail">
          <section class="cs-toolkit cs-resources">
            <h2 class="cs-label">Toolkit</h2>
            <div class="resource-list" id="cs-resources-list"></div>
            <p class="cs-events-empty" id="cs-resources-empty" hidden>No resources have been posted yet.</p>
          </section>

          <a class="cs-join" href="/clubs#community-service-clubs">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M3.5 19C3.5 15.9 6 14 9 14C12 14 14.5 15.9 14.5 19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M16 5.5C17.7 5.8 19 7.2 19 9C19 10.5 18.2 11.7 17 12.3M17.5 14.3C19.6 14.9 21 16.5 21 19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
            <strong>Join a club</strong>
            <span>See community service clubs and how to join.</span>
          </a>

          <a class="cs-idea" href="https://www.un.org/sustainabledevelopment/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M3 12H21M12 3C14.5 5.5 14.5 18.5 12 21M12 3C9.5 5.5 9.5 18.5 12 21" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg>
            <span>Need an idea? Browse the UN global goals</span>
          </a>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>

  <script src="common.js"></script>
  <script src="community-service.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
